title: macOS Ad-hoc HTTP Server Staging
id: e0e24b5c-190e-48b5-9557-b68dee862af4
status: experimental
description: Detects launching an ad-hoc web server on macOS (python3 -m http.server, php -S) used to stage files for download or serve payloads to other hosts.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/
logsource:
  product: macos
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'http.server'
      - 'SimpleHTTPServer'
      - 'php -S'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Developers testing locally
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.exfiltration
  - attack.t1567
